          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Fetch WO Details"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "FETCH_WO_DETAILS",
          "id": "1775123906366",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775123906368_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "For First Table Your input is {{$context.$nodes.VARIANCE_PROCESS_LOGIC.$output.result.resourceRows}}\nFor SecondTable Your input is {{$context.$nodes.VARIANCE_PROCESS_LOGIC.$output.result.materialRows}}\n\n\"No emojis in the answer, please.\"\nDo not show title\": \"Resource Usage Variance\" and \"Material Usage Variance\"(Strictly Apply)\n### Render ONLY:\n1) Summary paragraph \n2) First Table data from resourceRows without table title\n3) Second Table data from materialRows without table title \n\n### Do not show {{$context.$nodes.VARIANCE_PROCESS_LOGIC.$output.result.resourceRows}}, {{$context.$nodes.VARIANCE_PROCESS_LOGIC.$output.result.materialRows}} related data in single table. Show separately strictly.\n\nTitle: ** Continuous Improvement Advisor - Top Resources and Materials With High Usage Variance **\n\n\nUse data from: {{$context.$nodes.VARIANCE_PROCESS_LOGIC.$output.result.resourceRows}}\nSort the data by ResourceVariance in descending order (highest to lowest).\n\nColumns:\n- Work Definition Name → WorkDefinitionName\n- Item Number → ItemNumber\n- Resource Code → ResourceCode\n- Resource Variance → ResourceVariance\n\nDisplay format:\nWork Definition Name| Item Number | Resource Code | Resource Variance\n\nFor Resource Variance apply highlighting:\n- If > 30 → Red {{ResourceVariance}}%\n- If > 20 → Orange {{ResourceVariance}}%\n- If > 10 → Yellow {{ResourceVariance}}%\n\nResource Variance must be displayed as a percentage string.\nAlways append % to the numeric value.\nExample: 26 -> 26%\nDo not remove the percent sign\n\n## Action (per row) — STRICT BINDING (do not mix up)\nActionText: `Resource Detailed Insights` **ONLY**\n\n**followUpCommand**\n- For \"Resource Detailed Insights\" button\n  - `ora.Agent({\n  \"actionType\":\"resourceDetailedInsight\", \n  \"data\":{\n    \"WorkDefinitionId\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionId}}\",\n    \"OrganizationId\":\"{{input.OrganizationId}}\",\n    \"OrganizationCode\":\"{{input.OrganizationCode}}\",\n    \"OrganizationName\":\"{{input.OrganizationName}}\",\n    \"InventoryItemId\":\"{{input.InventoryItemId}}\",\n    \"WorkMethodCode\":\"{{input.WorkMethodCode}}\",\n    \"WorkDefinitionCode\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionCode}}\",\n   \"WorkDefinitionName\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionName}}\",\n    \"WorkDefinitionVersionId\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionVersionId}}\",\n    \"WorkDefinitionVersionNumber\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionVersionNumber}}\",\n    \"ItemNumber\":\"{{input.ItemNumber}}\",\n    \"WorkOrderNumbers\":\"{{input.WorkOrderNumbersCsv}}\",\n    \"OperationSequenceNumber\":\"{{input.OperationSequenceNumber}}\",\n    \"OperationName\":\"{{input.OperationName}}\",\n    \"WorkCenterId\":\"{{input.WorkCenterId}}\",\n    \"ResourceSequenceNumber\":\"{{input.ResourceSequenceNumber}}\",\n    \"ResourceCode\":\"{{input.ResourceCode}}\",\n    \"ResourceId\":\"{{input.ResourceId}}\",\n    \"ResourceSequenceNumber\":\"{{input.ResourceSequenceNumber}}\"\n    \"RequiredUsage\":\"{{input.RequiredUsage}}\",\n    \"ActualResourceUsage\":\"{{input.ActualResourceUsage}}\",\n    \"ResourceVariance\":\"{{input.ResourceVariance}}\",\n    \"PlannedStartQuantity\":\"{{input.PlannedStartQuantity}}\",\n    \"PlannedUsagePerProduct\":\"{{input.PlannedUsagePerProduct}}\",\n    \"ActualUsagePerProduct\":\"{{input.ActualUsagePerProduct}}\",\n  }\n})`\n\nImportant:\n- Show maximum 5 rows only\n- Do not display extra fields\n- Keep table clean and readable\n- Apply variance highlighting\n\nUse data from: {{$context.$nodes.VARIANCE_PROCESS_LOGIC.$output.result.materialRows}}\n\nSort the data by MaterialVariance in descending order (highest to lowest).\n\nColumns:\n- Work Definition Name → WorkDefinitionName\n- Item Number → ItemNumber\n- Material Item Number → MaterialItemNumber\n- Material Variance → MaterialVariance\n\nDisplay format:\nWork Definition Name| Item Number | Material Item Number | Material Variance\n\nFor Material Variance apply highlighting:\n- If > 30 → Red  {{MaterialVariance}}%\n- If > 20 → Orange {{MaterialVariance}}%\n- If > 10 → Yellow  {{MaterialVariance}}%\nMaterial Variance must be displayed as a percentage string.\nAlways append % to the numeric value.\nExample: 26 -> 26%\nDo not remove the percent sign\n\n\n## Action (per row) — STRICT BINDING (do not mix up)\nActionText: `Material Detailed Insights` **ONLY**\n\n**followUpCommand**\n- For \"Material Detailed Insights\" button \n- `ora.Agent({\n  \"actionType\":\"materialDetailedInsight\", \n  \"data\":{\n    \"WorkDefinitionId\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionId}}\",\n    \"OrganizationId\":\"{{input.OrganizationId}}\",\n    \"OrganizationName\":\"{{input.OrganizationName}}\",\n    \"InventoryItemId\":\"{{input.InventoryItemId}}\",\n    \"WorkDefinitionCode\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionCode}}\",\n    \"WorkDefinitionName\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionName}}\",\n    \"WorkDefinitionVersionId\":\"{{input.WorkDefinitionVersionId}}\",\n    \"ItemNumber\":\"{{input.ItemNumber}}\",\n    \"WorkOrderNumbers\":\"{{input.WorkOrderNumbersCsv}}\",\n    \"OperationSequenceNumber\":\"{{input.OperationSequenceNumber}}\",\n    \"OperationName\":\"{{input.OperationName}}\",\n     \"WorkCenterId\":\"{{input.WorkCenterId}}\",\n    \"MaterialSequenceNumber\":\"{{input.MaterialSequenceNumber}}\",\n    \"WdOperationMaterialId\":\"{{input.WdOperationMaterialId}}\",\n    \"MaterialItemNumber\":\"{{input.MaterialItemNumber}}\",\n    \"Quantity\":\"{{input.Quantity}}\",\n    \"IssuedQuantity\":\"{{input.IssuedQuantity}}\",\n    \"MaterialVariance\":\"{{input.MaterialVariance}}\",\n    \"PlannedStartQuantity\":\"{{input.PlannedStartQuantity}}\",\n    \"PlannedQtyPerProduct\":\"{{input.PlannedQtyPerProduct}}\",\n    \"ActualQtyPerProduct\":\"{{input.ActualQtyPerProduct}}\",\n  }\n})`\n\nImportant:\n- Show maximum 5 rows only\n- Do not display extra fields\n- Keep table clean and readable\n- Apply variance highlighting\n- **(Display the text exactly as provided, but replace every underscore character `_` with the HTML entity `&#95;`. Do not change anything else or any character other than `_`. Return only the transformed text.)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Variance Process Logic",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const toNum = (v) => {\n  const n = Number(v);\n  return Number.isFinite(n) ? n : null;\n};\n\nconst round2 = (v) => (v !== null ? Number(v.toFixed(2)) : null);\n\nconst avg = (sum, cnt) => (cnt > 0 ? sum / cnt : null);\n\nconst pctVariance = (actual, planned) => {\n  const a = toNum(actual);\n  const p = toNum(planned);\n  if (a === null || p === null || p === 0) return null;\n  return ((a - p) / p) * 100;\n};\n\nconst perUnit = (value, qty) => {\n  const v = toNum(value);\n  const q = toNum(qty);\n  if (v === null || q === null || q === 0) return null;\n  return v / q;\n};\n\n// ----------------------------------------------------\n// Read payload safely\n// ----------------------------------------------------\nconst raw = $context.$nodes.FETCH_WO_DETAILS_BY_DATE.$output;\nconst payload =\n  typeof raw?.response === \"string\"\n    ? JSON.parse(raw.response)\n    : raw?.response ?? raw;\n\nconst workOrders = payload?.items ?? [];\n\n// Keep only work orders that can be processed\nconst validWorkOrders = workOrders.filter(wo => {\n  return (\n    wo?.WorkOrderNumber != null &&\n    toNum(wo?.PlannedStartQuantity) > 0 &&\n    (wo?.WorkOrderOperation?.items?.length > 0) &&\n    wo?.WorkDefinitionId != null &&\n    wo?.WorkDefinitionCode != null && wo?.WorkDefinitionCode !== \"\" &&\n    wo?.WorkDefinitionName != null && wo?.WorkDefinitionName !== \"\"\n  );\n});\n\nfunction wdKey(wo) {\n  return [\n    wo?.WorkDefinitionId ?? \"\",\n    wo?.WorkDefinitionCode ?? \"\",\n    wo?.WorkDefinitionName ?? \"\"\n  ].join(\"|\");\n}\n\n// ----------------------------------------------------\n// Build Work Definition -> Work Order Numbers lookup\n// ----------------------------------------------------\nconst wdLookup = new Map();\n\nfor (const wo of validWorkOrders) {\n  const key = wdKey(wo);\n\n  if (!wdLookup.has(key)) {\n    wdLookup.set(key, {\n      WorkDefinitionId: wo?.WorkDefinitionId ?? null,\n      WorkDefinitionCode: wo?.WorkDefinitionCode ?? null,\n      WorkDefinitionName: wo?.WorkDefinitionName ?? null,\n     WorkDefinitionVersionNumber: wo?.WorkDefinitionVersionNumber?? null,\n      WorkMethodCode: wo?.WorkMethodCode ?? null,\n      ItemNumber: wo?.ItemNumber ?? null,\n      InventoryItemId: wo?.InventoryItemId ?? null,\n      OrganizationId: wo?.OrganizationId ?? null,\n      OrganizationCode: wo?.OrganizationCode ?? null,\n      OrganizationName: wo?.OrganizationName ?? null,\n      WorkOrderNumbers: new Set(),\n    });\n  }\n\n  const bucket = wdLookup.get(key);\n  bucket.WorkOrderNumbers.add(String(wo.WorkOrderNumber));\n}\n\n// ----------------------------------------------------\n// Aggregation containers\n// ----------------------------------------------------\nfunction initAgg(base) {\n  return {\n    ...base,\n\n    PlannedQtyPerProduct_sum: 0,\n    PlannedQtyPerProduct_cnt: 0,\n    ActualQtyPerProduct_sum: 0,\n    ActualQtyPerProduct_cnt: 0,\n    MaterialVariance_sum: 0,\n    MaterialVariance_cnt: 0,\n\n    PlannedUsagePerProduct_sum: 0,\n    PlannedUsagePerProduct_cnt: 0,\n    ActualUsagePerProduct_sum: 0,\n    ActualUsagePerProduct_cnt: 0,\n    ResourceVariance_sum: 0,\n    ResourceVariance_cnt: 0,\n  };\n}\n\nfunction addMetric(agg, field, value) {\n  const n = toNum(value);\n  if (n === null) return;\n  agg[`${field}_sum`] += n;\n  agg[`${field}_cnt`] += 1;\n}\n\nconst materialAgg = new Map();\nconst resourceAgg = new Map();\n\nfunction commonParent(wo) {\n  const wd = wdLookup.get(wdKey(wo));\n\n  return {\n    OrganizationId: wo?.OrganizationId ?? null,\n    OrganizationCode: wo?.OrganizationCode ?? null,\n    OrganizationName: wo?.OrganizationName ?? null,\n\n    ItemNumber: wo?.ItemNumber ?? null,\n    InventoryItemId: wo?.InventoryItemId ?? null,\n\n    WorkDefinitionId: wo?.WorkDefinitionId ?? null,\n    WorkDefinitionCode: wo?.WorkDefinitionCode ?? null,\n    WorkDefinitionName: wo?.WorkDefinitionName ?? null,\n   WorkDefinitionVersionNumber: wo?.WorkDefinitionVersionNumber?? null,\n    WorkMethodCode: wo?.WorkMethodCode ?? null,\n\n    WorkOrderNumber: wo?.WorkOrderNumber ?? null,\n    WorkOrderNumbersCsv: [...(wd?.WorkOrderNumbers ?? [])].sort().join(\", \"),\n  };\n}\n\n// ----------------------------------------------------\n// Process rows\n// ----------------------------------------------------\nfor (const wo of validWorkOrders) {\n  // ADDED: keep only Work Definition-based work orders\n  if (!wo?.WorkDefinitionId) continue;\n\n  const woQty = toNum(wo?.PlannedStartQuantity);\n  const parent = commonParent(wo);\n  const operations = wo?.WorkOrderOperation?.items ?? [];\n\n  for (const op of operations) {\n    const operationName = op?.OperationName ?? null;\n    const operationSequenceNumber = op?.OperationSequenceNumber ?? null;\n    const workCenterId = op?.WorkCenterId ?? null;\n\n    // -------------------- Materials --------------------\n    const materials = op?.WorkOrderOperationMaterial?.items ?? [];\n    for (const m of materials) {\n      const qty = toNum(m?.Quantity);\n      const issuedQty = toNum(m?.IssuedQuantity);\n\n      // CHANGED: only keep rows where issuedQty > qty\n      // ADDED: keep only rows where WdOperationMaterialId exists\n      if (\n        qty === null ||\n        issuedQty === null ||\n        issuedQty <= qty ||\n        !m?.WdOperationMaterialId\n      ) continue;\n\n      const plannedPerUnit = perUnit(qty, woQty);\n      const actualPerUnit = perUnit(issuedQty, woQty);\n      const variance = pctVariance(actualPerUnit, plannedPerUnit);\n\n      const key = [\n        wdKey(wo),\n        operationSequenceNumber ?? \"\",\n        operationName ?? \"\",\n        m?.ItemNumber ?? \"\",\n        m?.WdOperationMaterialId ?? \"\"\n      ].join(\"|\");\n\n      if (!materialAgg.has(key)) {\n        materialAgg.set(key, initAgg({\n          ...parent,\n          OperationName: operationName,\n          OperationSequenceNumber: operationSequenceNumber,\n          WorkCenterId: workCenterId,\n          MaterialItemNumber: m?.ItemNumber ?? null,\n          WdOperationMaterialId: m?.WdOperationMaterialId ?? null, // kept in result\n          WorkOrderOperationMaterialId: m?.WorkOrderOperationMaterialId ?? null, // ADDED: optional extra ID\n        }));\n      }\n\n      const agg = materialAgg.get(key);\n      addMetric(agg, \"PlannedQtyPerProduct\", plannedPerUnit);\n      addMetric(agg, \"ActualQtyPerProduct\", actualPerUnit);\n      addMetric(agg, \"MaterialVariance\", variance);\n    }\n\n    // -------------------- Resources --------------------\n    const resources = op?.WorkOrderOperationResource?.items ?? [];\n    for (const r of resources) {\n      const requiredUsage = toNum(r?.RequiredUsage);\n      const actualUsage = toNum(r?.ActualResourceUsage);\n\n      // Only process if ActualResourceUsage > RequiredUsage\n      if (requiredUsage === null || actualUsage === null || actualUsage <= requiredUsage) continue;\n\n      const plannedPerUnit = perUnit(requiredUsage, woQty);\n      const actualPerUnit = perUnit(actualUsage, woQty);\n      const variance = pctVariance(actualPerUnit, plannedPerUnit);\n\n      const key = [\n        wdKey(wo),\n        operationSequenceNumber ?? \"\",\n        operationName ?? \"\",\n        r?.ResourceCode ?? \"\",\n        r?.ResourceSequenceNumber ?? \"\",\n        r?.ResourceId ?? \"\"\n      ].join(\"|\");\n\n      if (!resourceAgg.has(key)) {\n        resourceAgg.set(key, initAgg({\n          ...parent,\n          OperationName: operationName,\n          OperationSequenceNumber: operationSequenceNumber,\n          WorkCenterId: workCenterId,\n          ResourceCode: r?.ResourceCode ?? null,\n          ResourceSequenceNumber: r?.ResourceSequenceNumber ?? null,\n          ResourceId: r?.ResourceId ?? null,\n        }));\n      }\n\n      const agg = resourceAgg.get(key);\n      addMetric(agg, \"PlannedUsagePerProduct\", plannedPerUnit);\n      addMetric(agg, \"ActualUsagePerProduct\", actualPerUnit);\n      addMetric(agg, \"ResourceVariance\", variance);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// ----------------------------------------------------\n// Final output\n// ----------------------------------------------------\nconst topN = 5;\n\nconst materialRows = [...materialAgg.values()].map(agg => ({\n  OrganizationId: agg.OrganizationId,\n  OrganizationCode: agg.OrganizationCode,\n  OrganizationName: agg.OrganizationName,\n\n  ItemNumber: agg.ItemNumber,\n  InventoryItemId: agg.InventoryItemId,\n\n  WorkDefinitionId: agg.WorkDefinitionId,\n  WorkDefinitionCode: agg.WorkDefinitionCode,\n  WorkDefinitionName: agg.WorkDefinitionName,\n WorkDefinitionVersionNumber: agg.WorkDefinitionVersionNumber,\n  WorkMethodCode: agg.WorkMethodCode,\n\n  WorkOrderNumbersCsv: agg.WorkOrderNumbersCsv,\n\n  OperationName: agg.OperationName,\n  OperationSequenceNumber: agg.OperationSequenceNumber,\n  WorkCenterId: agg.WorkCenterId,\n\n  MaterialItemNumber: agg.MaterialItemNumber,\n  WdOperationMaterialId: agg.WdOperationMaterialId, // kept in result\n  WorkOrderOperationMaterialId: agg.WorkOrderOperationMaterialId, // ADDED\n\n  PlannedQtyPerProduct: round2(avg(agg.PlannedQtyPerProduct_sum, agg.PlannedQtyPerProduct_cnt)),\n  ActualQtyPerProduct: round2(avg(agg.ActualQtyPerProduct_sum, agg.ActualQtyPerProduct_cnt)),\n  MaterialVariance: round2(avg(agg.MaterialVariance_sum, agg.MaterialVariance_cnt)),\n}))\n.filter(row => toNum(row.MaterialVariance) > 0)\n.sort((a, b) => Math.abs(b.MaterialVariance ?? -Infinity) - Math.abs(a.MaterialVariance ?? -Infinity))\n.slice(0, topN);\n\nconst resourceRows = [...resourceAgg.values()].map(agg => ({\n  OrganizationId: agg.OrganizationId,\n  OrganizationCode: agg.OrganizationCode,\n  OrganizationName: agg.OrganizationName,\n\n  ItemNumber: agg.ItemNumber,\n  InventoryItemId: agg.InventoryItemId,\n\n  WorkDefinitionId: agg.WorkDefinitionId,\n  WorkDefinitionCode: agg.WorkDefinitionCode,\n  WorkDefinitionName: agg.WorkDefinitionName,\n WorkDefinitionVersionNumber: agg.WorkDefinitionVersionNumber,\n  WorkMethodCode: agg.WorkMethodCode,\n\n  WorkOrderNumbersCsv: agg.WorkOrderNumbersCsv,\n\n  OperationName: agg.OperationName,\n  OperationSequenceNumber: agg.OperationSequenceNumber,\n  WorkCenterId: agg.WorkCenterId,\n\n  ResourceCode: agg.ResourceCode,\n  ResourceSequenceNumber: agg.ResourceSequenceNumber,\n  ResourceId: agg.ResourceId,\n\n  PlannedUsagePerProduct: round2(avg(agg.PlannedUsagePerProduct_sum, agg.PlannedUsagePerProduct_cnt)),\n  ActualUsagePerProduct: round2(avg(agg.ActualUsagePerProduct_sum, agg.ActualUsagePerProduct_cnt)),\n  ResourceVariance: round2(avg(agg.ResourceVariance_sum, agg.ResourceVariance_cnt)),\n}))\n.filter(row => toNum(row.ResourceVariance) > 0)\n.sort((a, b) => Math.abs(b.ResourceVariance ?? -Infinity) - Math.abs(a.ResourceVariance ?? -Infinity))\n.slice(0, topN);\n\nreturn {\n  materialRows,\n  resourceRows\n};"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775038109225"
          },
          "code": "VARIANCE_PROCESS_LOGIC",
