        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Resource Usage Change"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RESOURCE_USAGE_CHANGE",
          "id": "1775491481440",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775491481445_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Output Contract (MUST FOLLOW EXACTLY)\n\n### IMPORTANT: Disable implicit actions\n- **Do not generate any drilldown/navigation behavior**.\n- **Do not treat any cell value as a link** (render as plain text).\n- **Do not add any default “Actions”, overflow menus, row-click actions, or drilldown icons**.\n\n\n### Render ONLY:\n1) A header line  \n2) One table\n3) Action button\n\n### Header (exact text format)\n\n{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.ResourceCode}} Resource Usage updated to {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.ActualUsagePerProduct}} in the Work Definition related to {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}} Item with Work Definition Name {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionName}} .\n\n** Impacted Work Orders for Work Definition {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionName}} and Item Number {{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}}  **\n\n\n\n### Data source (ONLY this array)\nIterate **ONLY** over:\n`{{$context.$nodes.GET_WORK_ORDERS_RES.$output.items}}`\n\n- Ignore `{{$context.$nodes.GET_WORK_ORDERS_RES.$output.links}}`\n- Ignore each item’s `links`\n- **Do not infer any action** from any links (including drilldown)\n\n### Table structure (MUST be exactly 3 columns; no more, no less)\nColumns (exact order and labels):\n1. **Work order number** \n2. **Item Number**\n3. **Status**\n\n### Row mapping rules (STRICT)\nFor each item `wo`:\n- Work order number = plain text `wo.WorkOrderNumber`\n- Item Number = plain text `wo.ItemNumber`\n- Status = plain text `wo.WorkOrderStatusName`\n  - If `wo.WorkOrderStatusName` is null/undefined/empty => `N/A`\n\n\n### Prohibitions (CRITICAL)\n- Do not output drilldown, open, view, details, navigate, row-click behavior, or any other action.\n- Do not output any JSON blocks, metadata, explanations, or extra text—only the header + table.\n\nFor the Action button\n- ActionText: 'Sync Work Orders' **ONLY**\n**followUpCommand**\n- Must be exactly:\n  - `ora.Agent({\"actionType\":\"SyncWorkOrders\", \"data\":{\"OrganizationId\":\"<ORGANIZATION_ID>\",\"ItemNumber\":\"<ITEM_NUMBER>\",\"WorkOrderNumber\":\"<WORK_ORDER_NUMBER>\", \"WorkDefinitionName\":\"<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>\"}})`\n\n### Variable binding rules (CRITICAL)\n- `<ORGANIZATION_ID>` = `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.OrganizationId}}` **ONLY**\n- `<ITEM_NUMBER>` = `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.ItemNumber}}` **ONLY**\n- `<WORK_ORDER_NUMBER>` = `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.WorkOrderNumbers}}` **ONLY**\n- `<WORK_DEFINITION_NAME>` = `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_ACTION_CODE.$output.result.data.WorkDefinitionName}}` **ONLY**\n\n- **(Display the text exactly as provided, but replace every underscore character `_` with the HTML entity `&#95;`. Do not change anything else or any character other than `_`. Return only the transformed text.)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
